msgid ""
"This assessment was conducted using the ZaminTwin.ai automated road "
"inspection system. A vehicle-mounted camera captures road surface imagery "
"while GPS tracks the route. An AI model (YOLO-based, running on NVIDIA "
"Jetson) detects pavement defects in real-time. The Pavement Condition Index "
"(PCI) is calculated per 100-meter road segment based on defect type, "
"severity, and density, following principles from ASTM D6433. PCI ranges from"
" 0 (failed) to 100 (perfect condition)."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu baholash ZaminTwin.ai avtomatlashtirilgan yo‘l tekshiruvi tizimi "
"yordamida o‘tkazildi. Avtomobilga o‘rnatilgan kamera yo‘l qoplamasini "
"suratga oladi, GPS esa marshrutni qayd etadi. Sun’iy intellekt modeli (YOLO "
"asosida, NVIDIA Jetson’da ishlaydi) qoplama nuqsonlarini real vaqtda "
"aniqlaydi. Yo‘l qoplamasi holati indeksi (PCI) har bir 100 metrlik yo‘l "
"segmenti uchun nuqson turi, jiddiyligi va zichligi asosida ASTM D6433 "
"tamoyillariga muvofiq hisoblanadi. PCI 0 (yaroqsiz) dan 100 (a’lo holat) "
"gacha bo‘ladi."

